    >
      <title id="bb-framework-title">Blackbox connects behavior governance to runtime verification</title>
      <desc id="bb-framework-desc">The behavior governance lifecycle creates a human-approved behavioral harness. The runtime verification loop executes the harness, observes the running system, computes a deterministic verdict, and directs implementation repair.</desc>
