      <text x="48" y="100" fill="#93c5fd" font-size="10" font-weight="800">BEHAVIOR GOVERNANCE LIFECYCLE</text>
      <text x="48" y="128" fill="#eff6ff" font-size="16" font-weight="800">Define and approve the target</text>

